/E (CYDA is committed to implementing and maintaining the highest standards of efficiency and integrity in the purchase of goods and services. The overriding objective for all CYDA procurement activity is the prompt and effective provision of materials and services to CYDA.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
