/E (The manual can be periodically updated to reflect current circumstances and new policies and procedures. The concerned staff will be notified of updates by e-mail. The Senior Management Team will discuss the amendments and will submit them to the Executive Committee of CYDA. All amendments will have to be approved by the Executive Committee of CYDA.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
